{"version":1,"key":"card:619","content":{"id":619,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"愈发感觉到当前大模型的训练以及推理和人非常的相似。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"刷到这么一个"},{"type":"link","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/68a6aa231c4f9139467ad8d4?s=eyJ1IjoiNTY3YTUwZDQ2ZWY4OWMxMjAwOGE3NTc1IiwiZCI6MX0%3D&utm_source=post_card","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说法"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c095a693-ca4d-4e6a-b627-4318865170ad.png","uuid":"8795edd9-0504-4839-8269-887c75ef45dc","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c095a693-ca4d-4e6a-b627-4318865170ad.png","width":365.714291942363},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"把人的学习和大模型训练进行了一个映射："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"书中学 -> 预训练"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"高人聊 -> 后训练"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事上练 -> 强化训练"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由此我想到大模型的推理，特别是思考模式，它会在输出正式回答之前进行一次思考输出，然后才输出正式回答，添加这么思考的一个过程居然能把正确性提高非常多（在出现思考模式之前，人们会通过 Prompt 让模型一步一步来进行输出，CoT）。我突然意识到这个先思考的过程和写作的效果是一样的，在写作之前我脑中的思路是没有条理的，甚至有些理解还存在一些问题，但是在写作的过程中，经过不断的思考和调整，思路会变得清晰，对写作内容的理解也会更加深刻，添加写作这个过程同大模型添加思考的过程一样，对后续的输出具有极大的提升，这也证实了我的一个理念，"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":30,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":33,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"写作即思考"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并同时也表明了写作之重要性及必要性。"}]}],"tags":["随笔","学习方法"],"createTime":1756004061919,"updateTime":1759033659707,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1759033659707},"links":{"card:33":{"key":"card:33","type":"card","id":33}}}